# Product Rules

This project is PracticeOS: an adaptive AI skill-learning framework starting with beginner piano.

MVP users are total beginners/casual learners.

The first skill domain is piano only.

Core loop:
Teach → Try → Analyze → Explain → Adapt.

Do not build unrelated skills, advanced piano features, payments, social features, mobile app, camera analysis, or real-time feedback unless explicitly requested.

The MVP input pipeline is:
microphone recording → audio-to-MIDI transcription → confidence filtering → rubric-based evaluator → AI-generated coaching.

Always prioritize the smallest working version of the learning loop.
